  "worked_solution": "The absolute value of a positive number equals the number:\n\n$$\n|\\,3.8\\,|=3.8\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of a number gives the distance between the number and zero on a number line.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14145654/assets/809705575d4ab93d4a49a61e55ca3a0d458030e9692b6d6d905829c534acc9f1.png)",
